WEBVTT

00:02.503 --> 00:04.672
* *

00:23.557 --> 00:26.026
* *

00:30.198 --> 00:32.732
Previously on
Star Trek: Strange New Worlds...

00:32.866 --> 00:35.369
I'm in a relationship.
My life is complicated.

00:35.503 --> 00:36.704
Because Carol is pregnant.

00:36.837 --> 00:39.207
LA'AN:
Maybe I could be someone

00:39.307 --> 00:40.808
who takes chances more often.

00:40.908 --> 00:42.643
Spock and I made it very clear
with each other.

00:42.710 --> 00:43.977
No complicated expectations.

00:44.044 --> 00:45.213
Just fun times.

00:45.346 --> 00:46.980
(growls)

00:47.081 --> 00:48.316
-(grunts)
-(whimpering)

00:48.382 --> 00:49.717
CHAPEL:
You punched a dinosaur?

00:49.850 --> 00:51.552
I broke my hand
and I don't feel any pain.

00:51.652 --> 00:53.421
My whole body
feels more attuned.

00:53.554 --> 00:55.589
-M'BENGA: And your mind?
-Confused.

00:55.689 --> 00:57.057
Being Vulcan
affected you differently.

00:57.191 --> 00:58.692
-You are aggressive.
-(screams)

00:58.792 --> 01:00.728
Are you going to try
and take over the galaxy now?

01:00.828 --> 01:02.496
I don't know.

01:09.203 --> 01:11.405
(signal chiming)

01:23.584 --> 01:27.087
KIRK:
Personal log. Stardate 2903.9.

01:27.188 --> 01:28.989
The Future
Federation Leaders retreat

01:29.089 --> 01:31.024
was an overwhelming success.

01:31.091 --> 01:32.593
But my plan to hitch a ride home

01:32.726 --> 01:36.029
with fellow attendees
La'An and Spock has hit a snag.

01:36.130 --> 01:40.100
We detected a mysterious signal
in an uncharted region of space.

01:40.201 --> 01:43.103
It's the kind of thing
I joined Starfleet for,

01:43.204 --> 01:45.606
and yet for the first time,

01:45.739 --> 01:49.877
I can't shake the feeling
I'm in the wrong place.

01:51.212 --> 01:52.280
SPOCK:
Curious.

01:52.380 --> 01:53.646
The signal is being broadcast

01:53.747 --> 01:55.348
over an old
Federation frequency.

01:55.449 --> 01:57.985
Spock, no one likes
a back seat sensor reader.

01:58.085 --> 01:59.720
Apologies.

02:02.290 --> 02:04.057
(quietly):
Is everything all right?

02:04.158 --> 02:07.295
At the retreat,
you seemed distracted.

02:07.395 --> 02:08.662
I'm fine.

02:11.665 --> 02:13.334
Now that we're closer,
can you pinpoint a signal?

02:13.434 --> 02:14.735
LA'AN:
Sending coordinates.

02:29.517 --> 02:31.118
The Griffin.
